AlsaMixer.app build and installation

Requirements
-------------------------------------------------------------------
- C++17 compiler and make
- pkg-config
- X11, Xext, Xpm, and ALSA development libraries

Build
-------------------------------------------------------------------
From this directory, run:

    make

Install
-------------------------------------------------------------------
The default installation places AlsaMixer.app in /usr/local/bin, which is
normally on PATH:

    sudo make install

Set PREFIX to select a different installation prefix:

    make PREFIX=/usr install

For packaging, DESTDIR stages the installation without changing its final
paths:

    make DESTDIR=/tmp/package-root PREFIX=/usr install

Run AlsaMixer.app --help for command-line options.
